concepts.body_md:
Har module ne apni layer ke liye ek checker ship kiya: `check-agents.mjs` (contracts), `check-roster-flat.mjs` (topology), `check-mcp-config.mjs`, `check-agent-policy.mjs`, `validate-skill-library.mjs`, `check-handoff.mjs`, eval harness. `verify-system.mjs` in sabko run karta hai aur woh cross-layer checks jodta hai jo inme se kisi ke nahi hain:

- har agent ki har `skills:` entry ek aisi `.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` par resolve hoti hai jo preload ho sake (`disable-model-invocation: true` nahi);
- `settings.json` **aur** agent aur skill frontmatter mein har hook script path exist karta hai; har hook event ek documented event hai;
- `workflows/gates.settings.json` sach mein `Agent(developer)` se pehle poochta hai, aur har `Agent(...)` rule ek real agent ka naam leta hai;
- workflow step tables sirf roster agents aur existing skills ka naam leti hain;
- CLAUDE.md `@imports` resolve hote hain (code spans ke bahar, 4 hops tak);
- **guard reach**: preloaded skill jo bhi script agent ko run karne ko kehti hai, woh us agent ki `tool-guard.mjs bash-allow` list ke andar hai.

Aakhri check ne yeh module likhte waqt ek real defect dhoondha. `production-rca` step 1 sre ko `build-timeline.mjs` (PHI guard) chalane ko kehta hai, lekin `.claude/agents/sre.md` mein sre ka Bash guard node scripts mein sirf `count-queries.mjs` allow karta hai. Har part apna checker pass karta hai; saath mein sre exit 2 se block hue bina RCA start hi nahi kar sakta. Ek doosra, halka seam WARN ki tarah report hua: skills scripts ko `${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}/scripts/...` ki tarah invoke karti hain, jise Claude Code skill ki directory mein expand karta hai, jabki guard ek relative prefix ko literally match karta tha. Shipped fix `sre.md` mein missing prefix jodta hai aur `tool-guard.mjs` ko matching se pehle project ke andar ke absolute paths ko relative form mein rewrite karne deta hai, isliye dono forms pass hote hain aur verify-system bina warnings ke WIRED report karta hai.

Toh practically: CI mein `mvn -q -B test` ke bagal mein `verify-system.mjs` chalao, aur FAIL row ko broken build treat karo.
